me\":\"Somsak Chaisongkram\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9IapuFpWmvUqNoPRrk4y7BNlolW.jpg\"},{\"id\":83171,\"name\":\"Suthep Pongam\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1tXNE0LyqUFDdwTrJQCuIOfC706.jpg\"},{\"id\":1271265,\"name\":\"Sarinthip Siriwan\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5732587,\"name\":\"Benchawan Saetan\",\"character\":\"Muai Kiao\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1773838,\"name\":\"Pirawan Prasopsart\",\"character\":\"Nuan\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":566095,\"name\":\"Manop Aussawathep\",\"character\":\"Deputy Rueangsak\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f97ZRV1dJOBIDBesz0JraeaMmxu.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":575774,\"title\":\"His House\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/s6XxJEe4ovVTMgmGmKeO87OFANU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bNZB25TQxt0jEVgJOJ09tD2es7k.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2020,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After making a harrowing escape from war-torn South Sudan, a young refugee couple struggle to adjust to their new life in a small English town that has an unspeakable evil lurking beneath the surface.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":250230,\"title\":\"The Cut\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/QGmH2wYtZWyrFZ2T9VFOJntsfR.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nswukoPpvmWa8Jm3Yo0wYChJMTR.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1915, a man survives the Armenian genocide in the Ottoman Empire, but loses his family, speech and faith. One night, he learns that his twin daughters may be alive, and goes on a quest to find them.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Adventure\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1132574,\"title\":\"Cuarto de Hora\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xv2SYAbR4LmzSGyhS93cSA0VbVQ.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kDD4SC7HBpwVKo9KZqqtguOQ0Mv.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Alex (25), is a young Haitian man living in Chile who is undocumented and does not speak Spanish. After a car accident he is helped and translated by Daniela (50), a passerby with whom he is going to live what could be his last 15 minutes of life.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1318895,\"title\":\"KM 100\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1xkcceERyZzKW5u4Tluq2yvQNDo.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aBqpNCqpjLGugFy1pdMcqx9aGqO.jpg\",\"rating\":9.5,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Young African-Brazilian Miguel drives across the country in search of a long-lost relative to find out about his ancestry. However, a deeper understanding emerges through his encounters along the way.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":530431,\"title\":\"Bright Spring Days\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kCFOLUtwU3YjPmOjoko1L7DrrXd.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/rwEmz3KQd91Z6d6K1w6S99SVLHm.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Kuen is a lounge singer on Temple Street. Her son Kakei, now a university student, returns to Hong Kong for just a few days after emigrating to Canada with his father. Kuen's colleague Kit has to work overnight and enlists Kuen’s help to take care of her young son. During the sleepless night, Kuen and Ka-kei relive their past and envisage their future through another pair of mother and son. Under the bright sun, the cycle of life and family relationships continue, made all the more touching by the nuanced moments of care and concern between each other. SHAM Ka-ki of Weeds On Fire plays the son and renders a tender and layered performance full of subtlety.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":8932,\"title\":\"Salt of This Sea\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uWGCcevFpXGo3P7sx5Drofmz9T3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wW5gdp3XYzVYm9NDmWpTnUBI0PU.jpg\",\"rating\":5.9,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Born in Brooklyn to Palestinian refugee parents, Soraya decides to journey to the country of her ancestry when she discovers that her grandfather's savings have been frozen in a Jaffa bank account since his 1948 exile. However, she soon finds that her simple plan is a complicated undertaking — one that takes her further from her comfort zone than she'd imagined.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":518779,\"title\":\"See You Once Again\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rAM0VfMkGmuKKfn47HwcO6yVZpf.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tEsbTFY1oYivWiufxK4jDavVExD.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"It was the time when thousands of families left Hong Kong to look for a ‘better future’. After almost 20 years of separation, here comes the reunion dinner for a father and his daughter. The awkward distance between the two make them seem like strangers, but deep in their hearts hide their missing for each other. Memories intertwined with the present, both of them know that what really matters is your beloved ones are all well.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":612343,\"title\":\"Moon Rabbit\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kIbNko8Yf2QltIhbMeS6hBvjQD9.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nKJPKdNfXTLAFe5kMHnNsXMXnQ4.jpg\",\"rating\":2,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Seven-year-old Rio visits her grandparents in Japan for the first time. She observes the beauty and unfamiliarity of the household, sensing a distance between her American family and the Japanese relatives. When her mother, Seiko, reveals an open secret during tea, the children are excused from the room and something happens behind closed doors.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1460669,\"title\":\"Saffron Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hb0Avz6z7BWKvolmjMwZxen3YjD.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/83aahFsb3H80WesllQ0zyyCyJI9.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After her husband is abducted in Kashmir, a traumatised woman flees to the United States with her young son to rebuild their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Family\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":648461,\"title\":\"Night Working\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wjZcONUDiphfHEhfiTlxi9waIcU.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lin, a migrant female worker from Cambodia, and Yeon-hee, a Korean, are friends who work together at a factory at night. One day, the two will go to the sea together for the weekend. However, the factory manager only forces Lin to work overtime on the weekend, while Lin finds out that Yeon-hee is leaving Korea for Australia soon.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1074554,\"title\":\"Reparation\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bQUHuZQHCN2q1BjynvaABasZ4M5.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two semi-studious students living in 'Korea-Town' are interrupted & intrigued by the actions of a girl in a nearby building, witnessed via CCTV, whilst each trying to come to terms with important subjects in their university projects [one Korean related: the Sewol ferry tragedy, and one British: the Grenfell tower incident], as well as their own life challenges in this claustrophobic tragicomedy of alienation, helping hands & secretive students.  Is all really what it seems?\",\"genres\":[\"Mystery\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1075655,\"title\":\"Intrusive Thoughts\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yVrjBP0sSyn6FmuvFzr94zEa0X3.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7r6Q0TrCGfQyYp70kVUjbg29YHe.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the aftermath of a breakup, a struggling filmmaker becomes seduced by his therapist while his ex-girlfriend grapples with her identity and where to go next.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"sWYA8Hpm7fI\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"m1KCUGDTQak\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"IJzCT9REMgE\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}